    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.32,
      "en": "Hello English learners, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "您好英语学习者，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.72,
      "end": 6.18,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.52,
      "end": 7.04,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 7.68,
      "end": 13.6,
      "en": "And today we are going back in time again and this time we're going to be in the 1960s.",
      "zh": "今天我们又回到了时间，这一次我们将进入 1960 年代。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 13.7,
      "end": 14.1,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 14.26,
      "end": 21.78,
      "en": "We're going to learn some phrases and some slang that were really popular back in 1964.",
      "zh": "我们将学习一些在 1964 年真正流行的短语和俚语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 22.38,
      "end": 22.86,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 23.22,
      "end": 26.58,
      "en": "And most of these phrases and words we still use today.",
      "zh": "我们今天仍然使用这些短语和单词中的大多数。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 26.58,
      "end": 29.04,
      "en": "So it's very interesting and very good to know.",
      "zh": "所以这很有趣，很高兴知道。"
    },
    {
