      "start": 29.98,
      "end": 32.72,
      "en": "I'm looking forward to this trip back in time.",
      "zh": "我期待着这次旅行回到过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 32.72,
      "end": 34.68,
      "en": "So why don't we get started with the dialogue.",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不开始对话。"
    },
