      "en": "So now we heard them use the word man a lot, right?",
      "zh": "所以现在我们听到他们经常使用人这个词，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 506.36,
      "end": 506.86,
      "en": "Hey man.",
      "zh": "嘿，伙计。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 507.36,
      "end": 508.36,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 508.36,
      "end": 509.36,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 509.36,
      "end": 515.92,
      "en": "Now this is so common, even in modern English, that I think we need some examples.",
      "zh": "现在这很常见，即使在现代英语中，我认为我们需要一些例子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 515.92,
      "end": 516.2,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 518.16,
      "end": 519.56,
      "en": "Hey man, watch where you're going.",
      "zh": "嘿，伙计，注意你要去哪里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 522.04,
      "end": 522.34,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 523.58,
      "end": 525.18,
      "en": "Yeah, man, that's a great idea.",
      "zh": "是的，伙计，这是个好主意。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 526.96,
      "end": 528.36,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 529.14,
      "end": 530.62,
      "en": "Man, that was awesome.",
      "zh": "伙计，那太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 532.4,
      "end": 536.68,
      "en": "So man is one of those words that you just use at the end of your sentences.",
      "zh": "所以 man 是你在句子末尾使用的那些词之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 537.2,
      "end": 538.2,
      "en": "Or the beginning.",
      "zh": "或开始。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 538.2,
      "end": 539.2,
      "en": "Or the beginning.",
      "zh": "或开始。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 539.2,
      "end": 540.2,
      "en": "Anywhere.",
      "zh": "任何地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 540.2,
      "end": 541.38,
      "en": "And so you say, hey man, or yeah man.",
      "zh": "所以你说，嘿，伙计，或者是的，伙计。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 542.16,
      "end": 543.16,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 543.16,
      "end": 546.15,
      "en": "What about, do you have to be a man to use it?",
      "zh": "怎么样，你必须是一个男人才能使用它吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 546.44,
      "end": 548.76,
      "en": "Or do you have to be talking to a man to use it?",
      "zh": "或者你必须和一个人交谈才能使用它？"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 548.76,
      "end": 549.31,
      "en": "No, not really.",
      "zh": "不，也不完全是。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 550.12,
      "end": 551.73,
      "en": "Men and women use the word man.",
      "zh": "男人和女人使用男人这个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 552.6,
      "end": 555.8,
      "en": "And you can call a girl like, hey man, how are you?",
      "zh": "你可以叫一个女孩，嘿，伙计，你好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 555.8,
      "end": 556.8,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 556.8,
      "end": 559.63,
      "en": "But that sort of means that she's a really, really good friend.",
      "zh": "但这意味着她是一个非常非常好的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 559.96,
      "end": 562.88,
      "en": "Like the same level of friend as your guy friends.",
      "zh": "喜欢和你的男朋友一样的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 562.88,
      "end": 563.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 563.88,
      "end": 564.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 564.88,
      "end": 565.88,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 565.88,
      "end": 566.88,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 566.88,
      "end": 567.88,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 567.88,
      "end": 570.04,
      "en": "And now for the last phrase, I'm putting it together.",
      "zh": "现在对于最后一句话，我把它放在一起。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 570.04,
      "end": 572.05,
      "en": "He said, you go take care of business.",
      "zh": "他说，你去照顾生意。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 572.76,
      "end": 574.08,
      "en": "You take care of business.",
      "zh": "你照顾生意。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 574.25,
      "end": 574.43,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 574.47,
      "end": 576.51,
      "en": "So I have to take care of business.",
      "zh": "所以我必须照顾生意。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 577.48,
      "end": 580.92,
      "en": "So we're not really talking about business and work here, are we?",
      "zh": "所以我们不是真的在这里谈论商业和工作，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 580.92,
      "end": 581.92,
      "en": "No, no, no.",
      "zh": "不，不，不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 581.92,
      "end": 585.77,
      "en": "So basically what we're saying is, go handle your affairs.",
      "zh": "所以基本上我们要说的是，去处理你的事务。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 586.44,
      "end": 588.97,
      "en": "So do the things you have to do.",
      "zh": "做你必须做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 589.4,
      "end": 590.4,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 590.4,
      "end": 591.25,
      "en": "So, or solve your problems.",
      "zh": "所以，或者解决你的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 591.4,
      "end": 595.36,
      "en": "So if I say, I have to go to City Hall today and take care of some business.",
      "zh": "所以如果我说，我今天必须去市政厅做一些生意。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 595.36,
      "end": 597.75,
      "en": "So you're maybe going to do something like...",
      "zh": "所以你可能会做一些类似的事情..."
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 597.92,
      "end": 599.55,
      "en": "Pay my taxes or something like that.",
      "zh": "交我的税或类似的东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 599.88,
      "end": 600.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 600.88,
      "end": 601.88,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 602.7,
      "end": 604.4,
      "en": "So we heard some great phrases.",
      "zh": "所以我们听到了一些很棒的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 604.68,
      "end": 606.08,
      "en": "We saw these words.",
      "zh": "我们看到了这些话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 606.08,
      "end": 611.24,
      "en": "Let's listen to the dialogue for the last time, and then we'll come back and talk about this great decade.",
      "zh": "让我们最后一次听对话，然后我们会回来谈论这个伟大的十年。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 616.96,
      "end": 619.2,
      "en": "Hey man, I really like your pad.",
      "zh": "嘿，哥们儿，我真喜欢你这住处。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 619.68,
      "end": 621.08,
      "en": "Those lava lamps are far out.",
      "zh": "那些熔岩灯真酷。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 621.84,
      "end": 623.72,
      "en": "Thanks for letting me crash here tonight.",
      "zh": "谢谢你让我今晚在这儿借宿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 623.72,
      "end": 624.68,
      "en": "It's no problem, brother.",
      "zh": "没事，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 625.36,
      "end": 629.08,
      "en": "I wanted a pad where people could come, listen to music and just hang loose.",
      "zh": "我就是想有个地方，让朋友们来听听音乐、放松放松。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 629.64,
      "end": 630.38,
      "en": "You dig what I'm saying?",
      "zh": "懂我的意思吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 630.78,
      "end": 631.58,
      "en": "I dig it, man.",
      "zh": "懂，哥们儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 632.18,
      "end": 635.02,
      "en": "We should throw a bash here and make it a really happening scene.",
      "zh": "我们该在这里办场派对，好好热闹一番。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 635.84,
      "end": 638.04,
      "en": "Yeah, man, that would be groovy.",
      "zh": "是的，伙计，那将是 Groovy。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 638.24,
      "end": 640.48,
      "en": "Hey, I got to split for a while.",
      "zh": "嘿，我得先出去一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 640.5,
      "end": 641.46,
      "en": "Are you okay here by yourself?",
      "zh": "你一个人在这里还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 642.02,
      "end": 643.14,
      "en": "Don't worry about me, brother.",
      "zh": "别担心我，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 643.84,
      "end": 645.16,
      "en": "You go take care of your business.",
      "zh": "你去忙你的事吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 646.32,
      "end": 648.32,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 648.32,
      "end": 650.32,
      "en": "Peace out.",
      "zh": "回头见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 650.32,
      "end": 651.76,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 651.76,
      "end": 658.69,
      "en": "So 1960s, very famous among rock music, the peace and conflicts and all this stuff.",
      "zh": "所以 1960 年代，在摇滚音乐、和平与冲突以及所有这些东西中非常有名。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 658.97,
      "end": 659.39,
      "en": "Yeah, that's right.",
      "zh": "对，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 659.61,
      "end": 667.97,
      "en": "I guess in English or Anglo pop culture, we look back at this decade very fondly.",
      "zh": "我猜在英语或盎格鲁流行文化中，我们非常深情地回顾这十年。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 668.41,
      "end": 668.55,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 668.75,
      "end": 673.34,
      "en": "And also we really related to the hippie movement, right?",
      "zh": "而且我们真的与嬉皮士运动有关，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 674.24,
      "end": 679.5,
      "en": "People with long hair and baggy clothes, living in their cars, going from concert to concert.",
      "zh": "长发和宽松衣服的人，住在他们的车里，从一个音乐会到另一个音乐会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 679.84,
      "end": 680.84,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 680.84,
      "end": 688.58,
      "en": "And I mean, speaking of music, I think if we think 1960s, at least in Anglo world, we think of the best music.",
      "zh": "我的意思是，说到音乐，我想如果我们认为 1960 年代，至少在盎格鲁世界，我们会想到最好的音乐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 689.08,
      "end": 693.12,
      "en": "I think this is the golden age of music in English speaking countries.",
      "zh": "我认为这是英语国家音乐的黄金时代。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 693.34,
      "end": 695.12,
      "en": "Yes, it was a very good era.",
      "zh": "是的，这是一个非常好的时代。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 695.56,
      "end": 696.76,
      "en": "And well, what do you guys think?",
      "zh": "好吧，你们怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 696.76,
      "end": 702.08,
      "en": "Do you think the 60s was the best decade or maybe you are more fond of the 70s, the disco era?",
      "zh": "你认为 60 年代是最好的十年，还是你更喜欢 70 年代的迪斯科时代？"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 702.44,
      "end": 703.4,
      "en": "Or even the 90s.",
      "zh": "甚至90年代。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 703.5,
      "end": 705.38,
      "en": "There's some pretty good music in 1994.",
      "zh": "1994年有一些不错的音乐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 705.96,
      "end": 706.22,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 706.72,
      "end": 709.38,
      "en": "So come to our website and let us know what you think.",
      "zh": "所以来我们的网站，让我们知道你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 709.38,
      "end": 711.46,
      "en": "And also if you have any questions or comments.",
      "zh": "如果您有任何问题或意见，也可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 711.92,
      "end": 714.38,
      "en": "Marco and I are always around to answer your questions.",
      "zh": "马可和我总是在身边回答你的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 714.7,
      "end": 717.04,
      "en": "So thanks for downloading and until next time.",
      "zh": "所以感谢您的下载，直到下一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 717.16,
      "end": 718.16,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 718.16,
      "end": 719.16,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 719.16,
      "end": 726.256,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
